      "title": "Edge0 Releases Audio8-TTS-Realistic, a 0.6B Voice Cloning TTS Model",
      "url": "https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/10/29/edge0-audio8-tts-realistic-0-6b-voice-cloning/",
      "snippet": "Edge0 has released Audio8-TTS-Realistic, an open-weight text-to-speech model for zero-shot voice cloning. Audio8-TTS-Realistic is a 0.6B-parameter model that clones a voice from 1 reference clip and transcript. It supports 23 languages, 12 more than its predecessor. The weights and code ship under Apache 2.0."
